# Not part of the page. tools/ holds check_shaders.py (the repo-side check that
# the demo's copies are still the plugin's), build-wasm.sh and crosscheck/ (the
# page against gutest, frame for frame); wasm/ holds the page's host glue and
# GL shim, which are compiled INTO gauge-core.wasm, and the build's input
# manifest. wrangler would otherwise upload them and serve them, which is
# neither useful nor anybody's business.
tools/
wasm/
